      "t": "快走呀，下午一点就开三班了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry up; the three-shift schedule starts at one this afternoon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "辛惠美每个月都有粉丝凑钱帮她交违约金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei has devoted fans pooling money toward her penalty fee.'",
      "gap": 0.45
