    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "连小叶平时那么省钱，今天都舍得捐钱了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even thrifty Xiaoye was willing to donate money today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我们已经捐了目标金额的百分之一百四。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have already donated one hundred forty percent of the target amount.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢大家，我先回行政那边忙了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you everyone; I will head back to admin first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，一会儿一块儿去吃员工餐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, come eat the staff meal with us in a moment.'",
