      "t": "一部实行三班制太累了，公司给我们准备了高级的员工餐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because three shifts are exhausting, the company prepared a deluxe meal for Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "今天牛排还有鲍鱼这些都有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today they have steak, abalone, and everything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还是不去了吧，我又不是你们一部的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I had better skip it, since I am not part of Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.65
